"You can log in to an {openshift} cluster by using the OpenShift CLI (`oc`).\n"
"For more information, see link:https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.18/cli_reference/openshift_cli/getting-started-cli.html[Getting started with the OpenShift CLI]:"
msgstr ""
"OpenShift CLI ( `oc` ) を使用して {openshift} クラスタにログインできます。\n"
"詳細については、 link:https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.18/cli_reference/openshift_cli/getting-started-cli.html[OpenShift CLIを使い始める] を参照してください："

